flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer] --> PR[Pull Request]
    PR --> CI[GitHub Actions]
    CI --> TEST[Tests + Policy Validation]
    TEST --> SCAN[Trivy + Checkov + Secret Scan]
    SCAN --> BUILD[Build + SBOM]
    BUILD --> SIGN[Cosign Image Signing / Attestation]
    SIGN --> ECR[Amazon ECR]
    ECR --> GITOPS[GitOps Revision]
    GITOPS --> ARGO[Argo CD]
    ARGO --> CANARY[Canary / Progressive Delivery]
    CANARY --> VERIFY[Telemetry Verification]
    VERIFY --> PROMOTE[Promote]
    VERIFY -. failure .-> ROLLBACK[Rollback]
    PROMOTE --> OBS[Observability + SLO Validation]

    APPROVAL[Explicit Production Approval] --> ARGO
